WEBVTT

00:22:57.836 --> 00:23:00.716
and in their 60s found a whole community.

00:23:00.756 --> 00:23:02.916
One man found a community at a gym

00:23:02.956 --> 00:23:04.916
that he never dreamed he would find.

00:23:04.916 --> 00:23:10.796
And so the message that we get
from studying these thousands of lives is:

00:23:10.836 --> 00:23:12.916
it is never too late.

00:23:13.236 --> 00:23:15.996
And so don't assume
that it's too late for you,

00:23:15.996 --> 00:23:20.516
even if you feel like you've not had
good luck with this in the past.

00:23:20.556 --> 00:23:23.276
WPR: Well, Bob, we're getting
some questions about you.

00:23:23.316 --> 00:23:25.716
And I want to turn to you for a second.

00:23:26.556 --> 00:23:31.556
And I'm curious how running this study
has changed the way you approach life